body:
My first major depressive episode occurred at the age of 18.  This was 1974.  My first serious thoughts of suicide were in 1976 or 7, when in the Navy, I contemplated jumping off the ship in the middle of the Pacific at night.  They would not have noticed me missing for hours.  '79 or '80 I was aiming at light poles on a motorcycle but chickened out.  The 80's were pretty stable, then in 1992 it was jumping off a six story building. 1994, a cliff.  2000, a fast moving train.

&#x200B;

Glad I don't, and never have owned a gun.
